    'Large, almond or softly rounded eyes, with a gentle upward tilt at the outer corners. Their irises shimmer with velvety tones from warm chestnut and smoky amber to rare moonlit silvers and gem-bright violets with a reflective sheen that grants excellent night vision. Framing these eyes are lashes that are impossibly long and feather-soft, often darker than their hair. The eyes of the Rabbitkin are one of their most enchanting and disarming features, a blend of primal softness and deliberate allure.',
